     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p16-sine-rule-definition",
     "nodeId": "p16-sine-rule-formula",
     "replacement": "$\\frac{a}{\\sin A}=\\frac{b}{\\sin B}=\\frac{c}{\\sin C}$, where $a$, $b$, $c$ are the sides opposite angles $A$, $B$, $C$.",
